{"version":1,"content":"<p>視后李佳芯（Ali）昨日（27日）迎來44歲生日，她跟梁嘉琪及楊潮凱老友鬼鬼，獲兩人為她慶祝生日，嘉琪昨日在社交網分享慶生照，他們到了一間常去的餐廳食生日飯，她笑言：「呢間餐廳我哋嚟咗好多次，每次經理好好咁將我哋擺喺角落頭，應該係我哋啲笑聲</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T03:23:49.851680+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T03:01:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T03:17:13.527548+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T03:17:13.527548+00:00","content_hash":"bdba7d0e2e577d2d73c67eee6436255ce7f48e71d8abba61706025c93bd21726","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}